### Authentication API Tests

### 1. Health Check
GET http://localhost:8080/api/health
Accept: application/json

###

### 2. Signup - Register new user
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "testuser",
  "email": "testuser@example.com",
  "password": "password123",
  "fullName": "Test User",
  "githubUsername": "testuser-github",
  "githubToken": "ghp_your_github_token_here"
}

###

### 3. Login - With username
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "usernameOrEmail": "testuser",
  "password": "password123"
}

###

### 4. Login - With email
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "usernameOrEmail": "testuser@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

###

### 5. Get Current User (Add JWT token from login response)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/auth/me
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_JWT_TOKEN_HERE

###

### 6. Test Invalid Login
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "usernameOrEmail": "wronguser",
  "password": "wrongpassword"
}

###

### 7. Test Duplicate Signup
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "testuser",
  "email": "newemail@example.com",
  "password": "password123",
  "fullName": "Test User Duplicate"
}

###

### 8. Test Validation - Missing required fields
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "",
  "email": "invalid-email",
  "password": "123"
}

###
